{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Just Weigh 是一款專為 iPhone 而設的體重記錄應用，主打簡潔介面與私隱優先。它可以讓你快速記下每次量度結果，透過趨勢圖掌握體重隨時間的變化，而所有紀錄只保留在裝置本機，無需註冊帳戶，也不作雲端同步或數據分析。無論你習慣每天、每週或按自己的節奏量度體重，都能用它輕鬆記錄數字，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>快速記錄體重與趨勢圖</h2>\n<p>Just Weigh 以類似磅秤的選擇介面加快記錄速度，並支援 kg、lb 及 st/lb 三種單位。趨勢圖可自選日期範圍，亦可開啟移動平均線，讓進度變化更易閱讀。應用程式另備最近記錄摘要、完整歷史、編輯與刪除、逐筆備註及量度提醒，並可透過系統分享功能匯出 CSV 檔案，所有資料只儲存在裝置本機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-468-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-469-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-470-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-471-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-472-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-473-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Just Weigh</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:21.596994+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}